# Streamlit UI

Entry: `frontend/app.py`. Pieces: `auth_ui.py`, `chat_ui.py`, `sidebar_ui.py`, `api_client.py`.

- Keep login → upload → chat flow; do not add a new multipage app unless asked
- JWT lives in `st.session_state`; do not drop it on a slow first chat
- Call the API only through `api_client.py`
- Use `st.session_state` for widget state; no leftover `key=` that fights Streamlit
- Match existing layout and widgets; do not restyle the whole app in a small fix
